From: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi: Disable WARN and NOTICE subcategories by default

WARN and NOTICE masks enable routine diagnostics at startup. Initialize
both masks to zero. The Debug command can enable individual subcategories
when needed.

Signed-off-by: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
---
